" Toolroll  · shop  $1.84 today · plan 62%                                                     ◐ 2 working   2 need you  "
"  ╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   "
" ╭│ j/k            Move through the list                    Ctrl-E         Open this pane in $EDITOR                │─╮ "
" ││ ⏎              Open the changes, else the live output   :              Every action, task and setting           │ │ "
" ││ Tab/Shift-Tab  Next / previous tab                      PgUp/PgDn      Scroll up / down                         │ │ "
" ││ s              Steer: send the running agent a note     End            Follow the newest                        │ │ "
" ││ p              Pause the build (again to resume)        y              Copy to your terminal's scrollback       │ │ "
" ││ x              Stop the build, or its retries           w              Open Toolroll in your browser            │ │ "
" ││ X              Cancel task (asks first)                 ?              These keys                               │─┤ "
" ││ a              Accept the result                        q              Quit                                     │ │ "
" ││ r              Send back with a note; retry if failed   L              Next layout (one, two or four panels)    │ │ "
" ││ t              Open build shell                         o/O            Next / previous pane                     │ │ "
" ││ n              New task                                 </>            Narrower / wider list (or split)         │ │ "
" ││ T              New thread                               =              Even splits, usual list width            │ │ "
" ││ !/@            Next / previous that needs you           b              List: full, rail, hidden                 │ │ "
" ││ '              Jump back (again: forward)               z              Zoom the focused panel                   │ │ "
" ││ /              Search this pane                         A              Agents: add, sign in, choose models      │ │ "
" ││                                                                                                                 │ │ "
" ││ In Diff                                                                                                         │ │ "
" ││ j/k            Next / previous line                     c              A note on the line or hunk               │ │ "
" ││ Home           First line of the file                   Backspace      Remove the note here                     │ │ "
" ││ ]/[            Next / previous hunk                     e/E            More lines above / below the hunk        │ │ "
" ││ }/{            Next / previous file                     v              Side by side (a wide window)             │ │ "
" ││ n/N            Next / previous note                                                                             │ │ "
" ││ 1-9            Answer the agent's question              Ctrl-]         Leave a terminal you are typing in       │ │ "
" ││ Esc            Cancel, close, or go back                Ctrl-C         Quit                                     │ │ "
" ││ Keys: the default preset. Change any in tui.toml under [keys], e.g. preset = "vim" or accept = "f2".            │ │ "
